Chapter: DeskParseTest
  cites Works chapter GopDesk

 Pins GopDesk's pure pieces: BCD decode of CMOS RTC registers,
 two-digit zero padding, and the close-box hit test at the 1280x800
 scale-2 geometry the OVMF bed presents (window x 280, y 212; box
 x 968..999, y 212..251).

Section: Main

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    print-line-uni ("bcd: " & show (dk-bcd 0) & " " & show (dk-bcd 22) & " " & show (dk-bcd 89) & " " & show (dk-bcd 149))
    print-line-uni ("pad2: " & dk-pad2 0 & " " & dk-pad2 9 & " " & dk-pad2 10 & " " & dk-pad2 59)
    print-line-uni ("close: " & show (desk-close-hit 1280 800 2 990 230) & " " & show (desk-close-hit 1280 800 2 960 230) & " " & show (desk-close-hit 1280 800 2 990 260) & " " & show (desk-close-hit 1280 800 2 990 205))
  end
